title: "Ruach Studio"
abstract: "Open music generation that runs on your own hardware: the model, the score, the adapters and every take stay yours, and nothing is rented by the token. A whole studio around the open YuE2 model, with its own C++ engine and rooms to write, refine, paint, train and mix."
